-- החלטת ועדת מעקב מיום 12.3.2013 — שכר מנהלים ורמת המורכבות בתשע"ג: the
-- follow-up committee, under §160 of the base agreement of 25.12.2008,
-- decides how §67 of that agreement — as §46 of the completion agreement of
-- 29.2.2012 replaced it — applies in the school year תשע"ג to a principal
-- who goes on running the school he ran in תשע"ב. A change of the school's
-- complexity level that comes from the nurture index alone, or that no
-- change of 15% or more in the pupils or the classes accompanies, leaves
-- his pay as it was; any other fall is cushioned to a quarter of the cut,
-- paid as a "תוספת מורכבות נצברת תשע"ג"; a change of more than one level
-- counts as one; the January 2013 overpayments are deducted in four parts
-- and the earlier ones not at all; from תשע"ד the base agreement returns,
-- as if the decision had never applied, unless the parties agree otherwise.
--
-- It decides under the base agreement and the completion agreement, so it
-- imports what it applies: the replaced §67 and its accumulated complexity
-- supplement (the completion agreement's §46), the nurture index among
-- §66's parameters, and §160's committee.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT `base-agreement-66`
IMPORT `base-agreement-160`

-- The school years the decision speaks of (convention dates.school-year):
-- תשע"ב opens on 1.9.2011, תשע"ג on 1.9.2012, תשע"ד on 1.9.2013.
`5773 opens on` MEANS `the school year opening in` 2012
`5774 opens on` MEANS `the school year opening in` 2013

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the school year 5773` d IF
    d `is on or after` `5773 opens on` AND NOT d `is on or after` `5774 opens on`

-- A salary month, counted as y × 12 + m (convention dates.salary-month).
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 decision's salary month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

DECLARE `5773 complexity decision action` IS ONE OF
    `deduct an overpayment for September to December 2012`
    `raise a further claim on a matter the 5773 complexity decision settles`

§ `החלטת ועדת המעקב — שכר מנהלים ושינוי ברמת המורכבות בתשע"ג — 12.3.2013`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (21.7.2013, no. 97/2013); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The title, with the handwritten date; no rule.

-- The opening: the follow-up committee decides under §160 of the base
-- agreement on applying §67, as §46 of the completion agreement replaced
-- it, in תשע"ג. The decision is signed for the wages commissioner and the
-- union's secretary-general alone, where §160's committee has three seats,
-- the Ministry of Education's director-general being the third
-- (F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-a).
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:conclusions/t1
`the 5773 complexity decision's signatories` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the teachers' union`

`the 5773 complexity decision is signed by fewer than §160's seats` MEANS
        count `the 5773 complexity decision's signatories` LESS THAN count `the supreme committee's members`
    AND NOT elem `the Ministry of Education` `the 5773 complexity decision's signatories`
#ASSERT `the 5773 complexity decision is signed by fewer than §160's seats`

§§ `1 שכר מנהל הממשיך לכהן באותו בית ספר בתשע"ג`

DECLARE `manager under the 5773 complexity decision` IS ONE OF
    `the principal of a school`
    `the principal of an adjacent junior high school`
    `another manager`

@desc A principal, his school and its complexity level in תשע"ב and תשע"ג, as far as the decision asks.
DECLARE `principal under the 5773 complexity decision` HAS
    `post`                                         IS A `manager under the 5773 complexity decision`
    `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS A BOOLEAN @desc not one who moved to another school or started as principal in תשע"ג (§2)
    `level in 5772`                                IS A NUMBER
    `level in 5773`                                IS A NUMBER
    `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a change in the school's nurture index (§66(ב)(3) of the base agreement) and nothing else moved the level
    `change in pupils`                             IS A NUMBER @desc the change against תשע"ב, as a share (0.2 is 20%, up or down)
    `change in standard classes`                   IS A NUMBER @desc the change against תשע"ב, as a share
    `change in special classes`                    IS A NUMBER @desc the change against תשע"ב, as a share

-- The opening: notwithstanding §67, for תשע"ג only, §1 governs the pay of a
-- principal who runs in תשע"ג the school he ran in תשע"ב; §2 says the same
-- of one who moved or who started in תשע"ג (they are outside it), and §4
-- reaches the principal of an adjacent junior high school "and only" him.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_2 akn:art_4
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` p IF
        (NOT p's `post` EQUALS `another manager`)
    AND p's `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773`

-- The parameters (ב) names are three of those §66(ב) weighs for a primary or
-- junior high school; the nurture index of (א) is another.
`the parameters §1(ב) measures` MEANS
    LIST `pupils in the school`, `standard classes in the school`, `special classes in an ordinary school`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN x YIELD elem x (`the parameters weighed for` `a primary or junior high school`)) `the parameters §1(ב) measures`
#ASSERT elem `the nurture index` (`the parameters weighed for` `a primary or junior high school`)

-- (ב): "לא חל שינוי, אשר שיעורו הינו לפחות 15% ... באחד הפרמטרים" — no
-- parameter changed by 15% or more, up or down. 15% itself is a change of
-- "at least 15%". F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-b: the words
-- also bear "one of the parameters did not change by 15%"; the reading
-- adopted (convention reading.lists): the condition holds of every
-- parameter, so none changed by 15% or more.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_1__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a change of at least 15%` x IF
    x AT LEAST 15% OR x AT MOST -15%

GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the changes §1(ב) measures` p IS
    LIST p's `change in pupils`, p's `change in standard classes`, p's `change in special classes`

GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `no parameter of §1(ב) changed by 15%` p IF
    all (GIVEN x YIELD NOT `a change of at least 15%` x) (`the changes §1(ב) measures` p)

-- The other reading of (ב), for the finding's evidence only.
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `some parameter of §1(ב) did not change by 15%` p IF
    any (GIVEN x YIELD NOT `a change of at least 15%` x) (`the changes §1(ב) measures` p)

GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `levels the school moved` p IS
    p's `level in 5773` MINUS p's `level in 5772`

DECLARE `5773 pay outcome` IS ONE OF
    `the decision does not reach him`
    `no change in his pay`
    `a fall of his pay cushioned to a quarter`
    `a rise of his pay by the base agreement`
    `no change of level`

-- The clauses of §1 whose words take a principal, as printed: (א) any
-- change from the nurture index alone; (ב) any change with no parameter
-- moved by 15%; (ג) a fall outside (א) and (ב); (ה) such a fall of more
-- than a level; (ו) a rise of more than a level outside (ב); (ז) a rise
-- outside (ב) and (ו). (ו) and (ז) leave out only (ב), not (א).
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the clauses of §1 whose words take` p IS
    filter (GIVEN s YIELD NOT s EQUALS "")
           (LIST `if` inA "(א)", `if` inB "(ב)", `if` inC "(ג)", `if` inE "(ה)", `if` inF "(ו)", `if` inG "(ז)")
    WHERE
        moved MEANS `levels the school moved` p
        inA MEANS (NOT moved EQUALS 0) AND p's `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone`
        inB MEANS (NOT moved EQUALS 0) AND `no parameter of §1(ב) changed by 15%` p
        inC MEANS moved LESS THAN 0 AND (NOT inA) AND NOT inB
        inE MEANS inC AND moved LESS THAN -1
        inF MEANS moved GREATER THAN 1 AND NOT inB
        inG MEANS moved GREATER THAN 0 AND (NOT inB) AND NOT inF
        GIVEN b IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A STRING
        `if` b s MEANS IF b THEN s ELSE ""

-- (א)–(ב): no change in his pay in תשע"ג for the change of level. (ג):
-- another fall is cushioned. (ו)–(ז): a rise outside (ב) is paid by the
-- base agreement as the completion agreement amended it.
-- F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-c: a rise from the nurture index
-- alone is in (א) and, as printed, in (ו) or (ז) too. The reading adopted
-- (convention precedence.specific): (א), which speaks of exactly that
-- cause, as (ג) and (ה) leave (א)'s falls to it.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_g
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A `5773 pay outcome`
DECIDE `the 5773 pay outcome` p IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` p THEN `the decision does not reach him`
        IF `levels the school moved` p EQUALS 0 THEN `no change of level`
        IF p's `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` THEN `no change in his pay`
        IF `no parameter of §1(ב) changed by 15%` p THEN `no change in his pay`
        IF `levels the school moved` p LESS THAN 0 THEN `a fall of his pay cushioned to a quarter`
        OTHERWISE `a rise of his pay by the base agreement`

-- (ה)(1), (ו): a fall or a rise of more than one level, outside (א) and
-- (ב), counts for the pay as a change of one level from תשע"ב.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e akn:art_1__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_1__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the level his 5773 pay is computed at` p IS
    CONSIDER `the 5773 pay outcome` p
    WHEN `no change in his pay` THEN p's `level in 5772`
    WHEN `a fall of his pay cushioned to a quarter` THEN max (p's `level in 5773`) (p's `level in 5772` MINUS 1)
    WHEN `a rise of his pay by the base agreement` THEN min (p's `level in 5773`) (p's `level in 5772` PLUS 1)
    OTHERWISE p's `level in 5773`

-- (ג) ¶2: for (ג) only — and (ד) and (ה)(2) borrow it — "שכר" is the
-- combined salary plus the accumulated complexity supplement, where he is
-- entitled to one.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c/p2
GIVEN `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `accumulated complexity supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay as §1(ג) defines it` `combined salary` `accumulated complexity supplement` IS
    `combined salary` PLUS `accumulated complexity supplement`

-- What the replaced §67 pays after a fall but for the decision: the new
-- level's combined salary and the accumulated complexity supplement N of
-- §67(ג) as §46 of the completion agreement wrote it (imported).
GIVEN `combined salary at the level` IS A NUMBER
      `level value in each year so far` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `the level's value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `his 5773 pay but for the decision, after a fall` `combined salary at the level` `level value in each year so far` `the level's value` IS
    `pay as §1(ג) defines it` `combined salary at the level` (`the accumulated complexity supplement` `level value in each year so far` `the level's value`)

-- (ד), (ה)(2): the "תוספת מורכבות נצברת תשע"ג", beside any accumulated
-- complexity supplement: 25% of the difference between his pay in תשע"ב and
-- his pay in תשע"ג but for the decision — at the level (ה)(1) counts.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e__subpara_2
`the 5773 supplement's share of the cut` MEANS 25%

GIVEN `pay in 5772` IS A NUMBER, `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement` `pay in 5772` `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS
    `not below zero` (`the 5773 supplement's share of the cut` TIMES (`pay in 5772` MINUS `pay in 5773 but for the decision`))

-- His pay in תשע"ג, as §1(ג) defines pay. `pay in 5773 but for the
-- decision` is computed at `the level his 5773 pay is computed at` (the
-- principals' tables are an input).
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`
      `pay in 5772` IS A NUMBER
      `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `his pay in 5773 under the decision` p `pay in 5772` `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS
    CONSIDER `the 5773 pay outcome` p
    WHEN `no change in his pay` THEN `pay in 5772`
    WHEN `a fall of his pay cushioned to a quarter` THEN
        `pay in 5773 but for the decision` PLUS `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement` `pay in 5772` `pay in 5773 but for the decision`
    OTHERWISE `pay in 5773 but for the decision`

-- (ג): the cut is 75% of the cut the base agreement would have made.
GIVEN `pay in 5772` IS A NUMBER, `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cut §1(ג) makes` `pay in 5772` `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS
    75% TIMES `not below zero` (`pay in 5772` MINUS `pay in 5773 but for the decision`)

-- Worked example. A principal four years at level 3 (the base agreement's
-- example: each year's level value 2,436, level 2's 1,218) whose school
-- falls to level 2 for a cause outside (א) and (ב); a level-1 combined
-- salary of 10,000 for his grade is a placeholder. In תשע"ב: 12,436. But
-- for the decision: 11,218 and N of 487.2, 11,705.2 — a cut of 730.8. The
-- decision: the תשע"ג supplement 182.7, his pay 11,887.9, a cut of 548.1.
`a principal whose school fell from 3 to 2` MEANS
    `principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH
        `post`                                         IS `the principal of a school`
        `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE
        `level in 5772`                                IS 3
        `level in 5773`                                IS 2
        `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE
        `change in pupils`                             IS 0.2
        `change in standard classes`                   IS 0.05
        `change in special classes`                    IS 0

`his 5772 pay in the example` MEANS `pay as §1(ג) defines it` 12436 0
`his 5773 pay but for the decision in the example` MEANS
    `his 5773 pay but for the decision, after a fall` 11218 `four years at level 3` 1218

#ASSERT `his 5773 pay but for the decision in the example` EQUALS 11705.2
#ASSERT `the 5773 accumulated complexity supplement` `his 5772 pay in the example` `his 5773 pay but for the decision in the example` EQUALS 182.7
#ASSERT `his pay in 5773 under the decision` `a principal whose school fell from 3 to 2` `his 5772 pay in the example` `his 5773 pay but for the decision in the example` EQUALS 11887.9
-- (ג) and (ד) say one thing twice: the cut (ג) makes is the pay in תשע"ב
-- less the pay (ד) leaves, for every cut.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN cut YIELD
                `the cut §1(ג) makes` 12436 (12436 MINUS cut)
                EQUALS 12436 MINUS `his pay in 5773 under the decision` `a principal whose school fell from 3 to 2` 12436 (12436 MINUS cut))
            (LIST 0, 100, 730.8, 2436)

-- (ה): from level 4 to level 2 outside (א) and (ב) counts as level 3.
#ASSERT `the level his 5773 pay is computed at` (`principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH `post` IS `the principal of a school`, `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE, `level in 5772` IS 4, `level in 5773` IS 2, `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE, `change in pupils` IS 0.3, `change in standard classes` IS 0, `change in special classes` IS 0) EQUALS 3
-- (ו): from level 1 to level 4 outside (ב) counts as level 2.
#ASSERT `the level his 5773 pay is computed at` (`principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH `post` IS `the principal of a school`, `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE, `level in 5772` IS 1, `level in 5773` IS 4, `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE, `change in pupils` IS 0.3, `change in standard classes` IS 0.15, `change in special classes` IS 0) EQUALS 2
-- (ב): a change of exactly 15% is "at least 15%".
#ASSERT `a change of at least 15%` (15%) AND `a change of at least 15%` (-15%) AND NOT `a change of at least 15%` (14.99%)
-- (ב): no parameter moved by 15% — no change in his pay, the level as in תשע"ב.
`a principal whose school fell with small changes` MEANS
    `principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH
        `post`                                         IS `the principal of a school`
        `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE
        `level in 5772`                                IS 3
        `level in 5773`                                IS 2
        `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE
        `change in pupils`                             IS 0.1
        `change in standard classes`                   IS -0.1
        `change in special classes`                    IS 0
#ASSERT `the 5773 pay outcome` `a principal whose school fell with small changes` EQUALS `no change in his pay`
#ASSERT `his pay in 5773 under the decision` `a principal whose school fell with small changes` 12436 11705.2 EQUALS 12436

-- F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-b's evidence: in the example
-- the pupils moved by 20% and the classes by 5%, and the two readings of
-- (ב) part — by one the principal's pay falls, by the other it does not.
`the two readings of §1(ב) part for a school whose pupils alone changed by 15%` MEANS
        (NOT `no parameter of §1(ב) changed by 15%` `a principal whose school fell from 3 to 2`)
    AND `some parameter of §1(ב) did not change by 15%` `a principal whose school fell from 3 to 2`
#ASSERT `the two readings of §1(ב) part for a school whose pupils alone changed by 15%`

-- F-ofek-hadash-maakav-2013-03-c's evidence: a one-level rise
-- from the nurture index alone, with the pupils up by 20%, is in (א) and
-- in (ז) at once — no change in his pay, and the base agreement's rise.
`a principal whose school rose by the nurture index alone` MEANS
    `principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH
        `post`                                         IS `the principal of a school`
        `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE
        `level in 5772`                                IS 2
        `level in 5773`                                IS 3
        `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS TRUE
        `change in pupils`                             IS 0.2
        `change in standard classes`                   IS 0
        `change in special classes`                    IS 0
`a rise from the nurture index alone falls under (א) and under (ז)` MEANS
    `the clauses of §1 whose words take` `a principal whose school rose by the nurture index alone` EQUALS LIST "(א)", "(ז)"
#ASSERT `a rise from the nurture index alone falls under (א) and under (ז)`
#ASSERT `the 5773 pay outcome` `a principal whose school rose by the nurture index alone` EQUALS `no change in his pay`

-- akn:art_1__para_g/p2 A fax header; no rule.

-- (ח): one paid for January 2013 more than this section gives, the levels
-- for תשע"ג having been set late, has the excess deducted in four equal
-- parts from the salaries of February to May 2013; excesses paid for
-- September to December 2012 are not deducted.
@ref akn:art_1__para_h
GIVEN `paid in excess for January 2013` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the deduction of the January 2013 excess from the salary of` `paid in excess for January 2013` y m IS
    IF      `the 5773 decision's salary month` y m AT LEAST `the 5773 decision's salary month` 2013 2
        AND `the 5773 decision's salary month` y m AT MOST `the 5773 decision's salary month` 2013 5
    THEN `not below zero` `paid in excess for January 2013` DIVIDED BY 4
    ELSE 0

`not deducting the autumn 2012 excess` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    SHANT `deduct an overpayment for September to December 2012`

#ASSERT sum (map (GIVEN m YIELD `the deduction of the January 2013 excess from the salary of` 1000 2013 m) (range 1 12)) EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the deduction of the January 2013 excess from the salary of` 1000 2013 6 EQUALS 0

§§ `2 מנהל שעבר בית ספר או שהחל לכהן בתשע"ג`

-- §2 is encoded with the opening of §1 above (`the 5773 complexity decision reaches`).
#ASSERT NOT `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` (`principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH `post` IS `the principal of a school`, `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS FALSE, `level in 5772` IS 3, `level in 5773` IS 2, `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE, `change in pupils` IS 0.2, `change in standard classes` IS 0, `change in special classes` IS 0)

§§ `3 החל בתשע"ד`

DECLARE `what governs a principal's pay from 5774` IS ONE OF
    `the base agreement as on the eve of the 5773 decision, as if it had never applied`
    `the other arrangement the parties agreed`

-- ¶1: unless the parties agree otherwise for תשע"ד on, the base agreement
-- returns as it stood on the eve of the decision.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `what governs a principal's pay from 5774`
DECIDE `what governs a principal's pay from 5774` `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on` IS
    IF `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on`
    THEN `the other arrangement the parties agreed`
    ELSE `the base agreement as on the eve of the 5773 decision, as if it had never applied`

-- (א): the תשע"ג supplement is paid in תשע"ג only.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on` IS A BOOLEAN, `the other arrangement keeps the supplement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5773 supplement is paid on` d `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on` `the other arrangement keeps the supplement` IF
    BRANCH
        IF `in the school year 5773` d THEN TRUE
        IF NOT d `is on or after` `5774 opens on` THEN FALSE
        OTHERWISE `another arrangement was agreed for 5774 on` AND `the other arrangement keeps the supplement`

-- (ב): from תשע"ד the pay is computed as if the decision had not applied in
-- תשע"ג: on the תשע"ג pay but for the decision.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN `pay in 5773 under the decision` IS A NUMBER, `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 5773 pay the 5774 pay is computed on, by §3(ב)` `pay in 5773 under the decision` `pay in 5773 but for the decision` IS
    `pay in 5773 but for the decision`

#ASSERT `the 5773 supplement is paid on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the 5773 supplement is paid on` `5774 opens on` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the 5773 pay the 5774 pay is computed on, by §3(ב)` 11887.9 11705.2 EQUALS 11705.2

§§ `4 מנהל חטיבת ביניים צמודה`

-- §4 is encoded with the opening of §1 above: the principal of an adjacent
-- junior high school is in, and no other manager is.
#ASSERT `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` (`principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH `post` IS `the principal of an adjacent junior high school`, `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE, `level in 5772` IS 3, `level in 5773` IS 2, `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE, `change in pupils` IS 0.2, `change in standard classes` IS 0, `change in special classes` IS 0)
#ASSERT NOT `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` (`principal under the 5773 complexity decision` WITH `post` IS `another manager`, `ran the same school in 5772 and goes on running it in 5773` IS TRUE, `level in 5772` IS 3, `level in 5773` IS 2, `the change of level comes from the nurture index alone` IS FALSE, `change in pupils` IS 0.2, `change in standard classes` IS 0, `change in special classes` IS 0)

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- The decision exhausts every claim of the parties on what it settles, the
-- time before its signing included.
@ref akn:art_5
`no further claims on the 5773 complexity decision` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the 5773 complexity decision settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter the 5773 complexity decision settles`)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The Treasury's file number; no rule.
